flowchart TB
    A[configs/labels.yaml: 9 classes, keywords, target 1200/class] --> B[Crawl missing labels]
    B --> C[data/raw/class]
    C --> D[Validate images with Pillow]
    D --> E[Reject unreadable or smaller than 128x128]
    D --> F[Convert RGB JPEG, quality 95, rename class_000001.jpg]
    F --> G[data/cleaned/class]
    G --> H[pHash duplicate check, Hamming <= 4, within same class]
    H --> I{Near duplicate?}
    I -- Yes --> J[data/duplicates/class and duplicates.csv]
    I -- No --> K[Keep cleaned image]
    K --> L[Balance to max 1200/class and drop noisy label taxi]
    L --> M[Manual review when needed]
    M --> N[Dataset statistics and figures]
    N --> O[Final cleaned dataset: 10,767 images]
    O --> P[Upload cleaned class folders to Kaggle dataset]
    P --> Q[MobileNet notebook]
    P --> R[ResNet notebook]
    Q --> S[MobileNetV2, weights=None, single phase training]
    R --> T[ResNet50V2, weights=None, single phase training]
    S --> U[Test evaluation and artifacts]
    T --> U
    U --> V[Compare accuracy, macro precision, recall, F1, params, time]
